	"data": "Concept: Local AI Infrastructure\n\nWhat It Is\ncithoreal's vision for AI is self-hosted first, cloud as bridge. He has been designing and building toward a local conversational AI assistant — one with persistent memory, access to his personal data, and no dependency on external services — since at least mid-2024.\n\nThis is both a homelab project and a philosophical position: his data, his models, his compute.\n\nDesign Sessions (2024 H2)\n\nConversational AI Assistant Plan (Sep 2024)\nDetailed…",
